          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            %em Leptoquarks
            is the name given to hypothetical
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fundamental+particles"} fundamental particles
            which combine the properties of both
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quarks"} quarks
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/leptons"} leptons
            from the
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/standard+model+of+particle+physics"} standard model of particle physics
          %p
            They naturally arise in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/grand+unified+theories"} grand unified theories
            (e.g.
            = succeed "," do
              %a{:href => "#MurayamaYanagida92"} Murayama-Yanagida 92
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "#AFG17"} AFG 17, III.A
          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#ExperimentalHint Experimental hints
          %p
            The existence of leptoquarks could potentially explain
            %em both
          %ol
            %li
              %p
                the apparently observed
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/flavour+anomalies"} flavour anomalies
              %p
                (
                %a{:href => "#BauerNeubert16"}> Bauer-Neubert 16
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#CCDM16"} CCDM 16
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#CCL17"} CCL 17
                %a{:href => "#Crivellin17"} Crivellin 17
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#Falkowski17"} Falkowski17
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#Mueller18"} Müeller 18
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#MatsuzakiNishiwaki18"} Matsuzaki-Nishiwaki 18
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#MonteuxRajaraman18"} Monteux-Rajaraman 18
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#AMST18"} AMST 18
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#BDFKFS18"} BDFKFS 18
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#Crivellin18"} Crivellin 18
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#MMR18"} MMR 18
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#BlankeCrivellin18"} Blanke-Crivellin 18
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#KumarLondon19"} Kumar-London 19, section 2.2.1
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#MVT19"} MVT 19
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "#MVK19"} MVK 19
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "#CataMannel19"} Cata-Mannel 19
            %li
              %p
                the apparently observed
                %a{:href => "anomalous+magnetic+moment#Anomalies"} anomaly
                in the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/anomalous+magnetic+moments"} anomalous magnetic moments
                of the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/muon"} muon
                and also of the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/electron"} electron
                (
